window.products.push({"id":536141,"name":"Hammont Wooden Nested Serving Trays - 7 Pack - Set of Rectangular Shape Wood Trays for Crafts with Cut Out Handles | Kitchen Nesting Trays for Serving","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QTHpGJxXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wooden Serving Trays: Hammont serving trays set are great for a variety of occasions including everyday meals, parties and special gatherings. This Wooden tray set makes it easyâand stylishâto move dishes from the kitchen to the dining room. Made from sturdy, this Nested Serving Tray is perfect for a \"breakfast in bed\" type of morning or serving cup of teas to your guests. Simply clean with warm water or damp cloth then store in a dry place. These set of 5 wooden trays are unfinished so you can paint any color you want. This nesting tray set will make a great addition to any dÃ©cor. The bare wood can be embellished in so many crafty ways-paint decoupage stencils beads fabric or simply leave it as it is for a natural and straightforward look. Trays Size: 6\"x10.25\"x1.5\" 15.3\"x9\"x1.5\" 14.5\"x8.25\"x1.4\" 13.75\"x7.5\"x1.3\" 13\"x6.6\"x1.25â Ideal for Parties & Celebrations: If you are hosting a party and looking for an affordable way to add quality to your dining or living room, our wooden serving trays are sure to be a hit. This set of hand-crafted wooden trays are sure to up the design quotient at any party, brunch, or dinner gathering. Larger serving tray for spacious portability and the smaller trays are designed to nest inside the larger one for convenient storage; they are ideal to be used as a serving tray or even dÃ©cor. Serve Drinks or Food: The trays are designed to hold heavier weights such as glass, plates, coffee mugs and serving pastries, snacks, mini bars, chocolate. Each tray also comes with oval cutout handles on the sides, thus making it easy for you to carry breakfast, lunch, or dinner from the kitchen to the table easily. Simple Style: This simple and natural style can bring a decorative touch to any space. The breakfast tray can be matched with any tableware to create a perfect home decoration. Whether it's a housewarming, wedding, Mother's Day, Father's Day or Christmas, this wood serving trays set is the best gift choice! Tray's surface ensures smoothness and finer corner grinding. You can choose different sizes according to your needs. Hammont: Hammont offers quality products, satisfying your needs. The brand provides you with the best Novelty products available in todayâs market by researching, testing and designing its products thoroughly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QTHpGJxXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hammont","source_asin":"B097HTMPYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097HTMPYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097HTMPYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
