window.products.push({"id":536248,"name":"Salt and Pepper Grinders, Premium Wooden Pepper Grinder Pepper Mill, Ceramic Rotor with Strong Adjustable Coarseness-8 inches [Set of 2]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+jI31RLlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Salt and pepper grinders support the wonderful culinary experience for every person who loves cooking and hosting meal gatherings. Manual Pepper and Salt Mill, Wooden Adjustable Pepper Grinder Spice Shaker for Professional and Home Kitchen Use. It is a must have for any kitchen and table, crushing and grinding pepper or salt can be bit messy and troublesome at times, but these grinders will make the job much easier.  This salt and pepper mill is portable and practical,wide uses. Suitable for picnics, dinners, parties, kitchens, restaurants, barbecues and hotel use. For pepper, sea salt, black pepper and more seasonings for camping, picnics, barbecues and daily cooking, also as a kitchen or table decoration, it adds fun to your life. Features for this pepper grinders: 1: Professional Salt and Pepper shaker with Clear Acrylic Window, 8 inches for the product. 2: Elegant and Durable Wooden, smooth touch  3: Easy to use and refill, easily refill the sea salt or black pepper to the pepper mill or salt grinder by removing the top cover, with no mess.  4: Ceramic Grinding Mechanism, Non-corrosive, no plastic material, very healthy and environmentally, you can adjust the coarseness of Himalayan salt or pepper from fine to coarse by twisting the stainless steel nut on top.  5: The Perfect Gift Set, being as a practical gift, elegant salt and pepper grinder always a right choice. Perfect for birthdays, wedding, anniversary, housewarming,Mother’s Day or Valentine's Day! How to Use STEP 1: Open the stainless steel nut and remove the top cover. STEP 2: Refill the salt and pepper grinder with wood spoons. STEP 3: Put the cover back in place and screw back the screws to adjust the thickness of the particles. Whether it is fine or rough, it is your choice. Rotate the wooden lid for grinding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+jI31RLlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hanaiette","source_asin":"B0B6TXY1R8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6TXY1R8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6TXY1R8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
