window.products.push({"id":536291,"name":"Cohas Birthday Milestone Board for Pets with Bone and Reusable Chalkboard Style Surface, 12 by 16 Inches, White Marker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LXcZklyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cohas Chalkboard System Milestone Boards are designed to look like a real chalkboard you can use again and again. These milestone boards are perfect for capturing your fur baby's growth. This special pet birthday board features a simple dog bone designed in real chalk art, and a smooth, satin chalkboard style surface.This kit comes with a wet-wipe liquid chalk marker. The premium marker features a chisel 6mm tip, perfect for making thick and thin chalk-like lines about 1/8-inches wide. The marker's wet-wipe ink means it will remove easily with water. When using other markers, certain colors and brands may cause staining or damage board; test markers in a small section before writing on your board. Do not use real chalk on this board.Milestone boards are easy to clean and reuse. Add your pet's name, age, favorite treats and toys, and other information and allow to dry. Once your photo shoot is over, use water or a gentle cleaner like Windex to remove your marker's ink. Do not use abrasive cleaners or magic erasers; they will damage the board's surface. Rewrite on the board again and again!The board features real chalk art and a chalkboard embedded onto a hardboard material, then cut to size. Rounded corners are stamped to avoid sharp edges. Finished board measures 12 by 16 inches, by 0.13 inches thick.Ziggyboard has now become Cohas! Still providing the same products and customer service you've come to know and love, but under a new name! And new to the change, Cohas products purchased through authorized resellers come with a one-year warranty!Safe in your home. Markers have the CE mark, meet Toy Safety Regulation EN-41, and bear AP Seal ASTM D4236. Board is GREENGUARD Gold Certified by UL (Underwriter Laboratories), ensuring it is safe for use in environments like schools and healthcare facilities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LXcZklyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cohas","source_asin":"B084T6R4ZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084T6R4ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084T6R4ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":536292,"name":"blue page Boho Throw Pillow Covers Tufted Cotton Woven Yarn Pillow Covers 12X20 Set of 2 Farmhouse Decorative Pillow Covers for Couch Sofa Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lchDpjP+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton [Farmhouse Throw Pillow Covers 12x20]Blue page boho throw pillows cover is woven in black and cream white yarn. The tufted accents add a bohemian and modern farmhouse look. Simple textures and neutral patterns allow this pillow to stand out. The tassels are hand-woven to make this pillowcase look like a work of art. These farmhouse pillows covers are elegant and make an excellent addition to your home living space. [More Thick and Durable Decorative Pillow Covers]The woven boho throw pillow cover is much thicker than the ordinary polyester fabric, is crafted of 100% thick yarn-dyed cotton. These tufted pillow covers will not wear over time and show no age! The fabrics are reinforced with beautiful stitching, lending themselves to outlasting performance over the years. [Accent Home Decor Pillow Covers]These two boho pillow covers have a designer look and feel and will stand out in the mix, they boast high-grade elegance in the home, office or even spas and hotels. Perfect decor for Couch and Sofa. Goes well with any boho or farmhouse style design of any living room, bedroom, or office, sunroom, den, kitchen benches, patio sets, nursery and more. [Invisible Zipper and Packae] The invisible zipper design not only gives this boho pillow cover a more elegant appearance. And the sturdy invisible zipper closures work smoothly, easy to wipe and clean. Attention! We are selling a set of 2 pillow covers. The pillow inserts are not included. You need to buy your own pillow filler. [Care Instructions] For the woven tufted pillow covers, we recommend hand washing separately. To prolong the life of the tassels and tufting, turn the pillowcase inside out and then hand wash it. The first cleaning may have some floating fiber, which is normal. Please contact us if you have any questions, we will give you a satisfactory solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lchDpjP+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"blue page","source_asin":"B0B4Z8PBCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4Z8PBCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4Z8PBCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
