window.products.push({"id":536556,"name":"Bamboo Waterproof Mattress Protector King Size, Cooling Breathable Mattress Cover, Fitted Deep Pocket Mattress Pad Cover Stretches up to 21 Inches, No","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719YlTCg5dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎋【Cooling Bamboo Mattress Protector】：Made of bamboo fiber, have tiny gaps in the fabric, allow air to circulate through, moisture-wicking, breathable, absorbing moisture from your skin doesn't make you feel stuffy, keep cooling & dry all night, even in hot weather. Perfect for hot sleepers & night sweats. 🎋【100% Waterproof Mattress Pad Cover】: Our king bamboo mattress protector adopting waterproof TPU backing is designed to be an invisible waterproof barrier to protect your expensive mattress, effectively repelling all liquids (including accidental spills, bodily fluids like sweat or urine). Also, it’s a great gift for those who are bedwetting kids, pet lovers, women & older. 🎋【Noiseless Deep Docket Bed Cover】: This King Size mattress protector (78\" x 80\") is noiseless and will not make an annoying crinkling noise when you move on your bed. The high thread count skirt protects all sides of your valuable mattress with great stretchability to fit the depth of a 6\"-21\" mattress, an ideal choice of memory foam mattress or latex mattress. 🎋【Machine Washable Mattress Cover】: Wash the bamboo mattress cover on a gentle cycle or delicate setting with two rinse cycles, using cold water and normal household detergents that do not contain bleach. Dry the mattressprotector at low temperature or under sunshine, make sure that the mattress cover is completely dry before putting it to bed. 🎋【Dedicated Customer Service】 - We provide 180-day Return/Replacement Service. If you are not satisfied FOR ANY REASON, Pls contact our Customer Support and we will do everything to make you satisfied. Machine wash cold separately on GENTLE/DELICATE cycle. Tumble dry on low. Do not bleach. Do not dry clean. We suggest you buy 2 pieces or more, so you can change one while washing the other.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719YlTCg5dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JamRest","source_asin":"B0BNL1NMXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNL1NMXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNL1NMXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
