window.products.push({"id":536628,"name":"LUCKYCFD Custom Blanket with Photos Text, Personalized Pictures Collage Customized Flannel Throw Blankets, Personalized Gifts for Baby Newborn Adult K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pZfnFzUQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Personalized Blanket】: This is a personalized blanket, you can upload your family, friends, pet, anime or your favorite photos to design your own soft blanket. This is simple online design, click the \"Customize Now\" button and upload your photos, resize/position them to your desired effect, then add to cart, submit order and we will turn your warm memories into into a one-of-a-kind blanket. 【Comfortable Quality Material】Our customized flannel blanket is made of high quality anti-pilling flannel, lightweight and warm, durable. Super soft and excellent handfeel. Completely resists shrinkage and wrinkling. Our blanket has a velvety texture, very soft to the touch, with anti-pilling, anti-wrinkle, anti-allergy and non-fluffing features. 【Perfect Gift】: This super soft and comfortable blanket is a particularly thoughtful gift, whether it is for yourself, family or friends. This super soft and comfortable blanket makes a great gift. Perfect for holiday or anniversary gifts, such as Father's Day, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Valentine's Day, Birthday, Wedding Anniversary Gifts and more. It will touch your heart with your beautiful thoughts and precious memories. This is an excellent gift for all ages! 【Widely Application】This flannel throw blanket will be a perfect indoor decoration to your home, bedroom, living room, dorm room, kid room, also goes well with patio porch, car, chair, couch, sofa, bed. It is also suitable for an outdoor concerts, sporting events, travel, camping or anywhere you need to stay snuggle warm. It’s wonderful experience when surround yourself with customized blankets while watching TV series with a mug of hot chocolate on couch, especially on chilly nights. 【Note】: 1. This blanket is printed on one side, and the side without printing is white. 2. Please send us a high-definition picture and we will help you adjust your photo or text to achieve the best effect. 3. Gentle separate machine wash in cold water, preferably in a mesh laundry bag to wash the blanket. Dry at low temperature. Do not iron or heat press. Finally if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pZfnFzUQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCKYCFD","source_asin":"B0BVDJ337L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVDJ337L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVDJ337L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
