window.products.push({"id":536661,"name":"Stradford Framed Full-Length Mirror and Storage - Over the Door - 15 x 48 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eWxSGR-ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ultimate solution for a mess-free and uncluttered mirror and storage organizer is the Stradford Framed Full-Length Mirror and Storage ! This Framed Full-Length Mirror and Storage is the ideal mirror for any room with limited space. It is a perfect solution for students in a dorm room or young adults in a shared living environment . This 44 x 12-inch full-length mirror has a magnetic door closure that comes with a lock and two sets of keys to keep valuables such as wallets, documents, and electronic devices safe. It also includes four shelves for storing your makeup and other bathroom kits. There are also eight hooks included for hanging your precious jewelry, keeping your necklaces and bracelets untangled. Additionally, this Full-Length Mirror and Storage provides room for your personal notes and self-reminders . Pin your monthly electricity and water bills or paste photos of your loved ones on it. You can also write your reminders on the built-in dry white board when the corkboard is overloaded with your notes for school or work. A dry erase marker with an eraser cap is included in this set. The Stradford Framed Mirror and Storage includes two over-the-door hangers with easy-to-follow instructions on how to hang your mirror as well as a hook and loop fastener to secure the attachment between the door and the mirror. With this product, you won’t have a hard time relocating your full-length mirror when needed. This mirror with storage also includes elastic straps on the shelves to keep your valuables secured when you transfer it. Prepare yourself for a fresh and tidy morning in front of a simple, elegant mirror while keeping your belongings organized with the Stradford Framed Full-Length Mirror and Storage! This product is available in Black or White .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eWxSGR-ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DesignOvation","source_asin":"B07MJMDSRR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MJMDSRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MJMDSRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
