window.products.push({"id":536675,"name":"GorgeousHomeLinen (M12) 1 Deep Red Faux Silk Grommet Elegant Waterfall Window Small Valance with Decorative Tassels 34\"x15\" Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HWWuOlVoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This faux silk grommet waterfall valance with hanging decorative tassels will make your living room look elegant it can be used in any room in your home it also can be used in the kitchen or even the bathroom! It is very easy to slide in a 2\" 1/2 inch or less Rod Pole.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HWWuOlVoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorgeous Home LINEN","source_asin":"B0728BYS8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0728BYS8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0728BYS8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":536676,"name":"Shun Hiro SG2 9-inch Bread Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q5OOyA+JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Shun Hiro SG2 Bread Knife will be your loaf's new best friend, no matter what its texture. The key is Shun's razor-sharp, serrations. Unlike a plain-edged knife, the serrations let you gently saw through the bread without crushing and with much less crumbing. This keeps the bread's texture intact and enhances eating pleasure. Cakes and pastries also benefit for smooth cutting capabilities. Shun Hiro SG2 combines striking beauty with peerless performance. In Japanese, the name Hiro is known as \"abundant,\" \"generous,\" and \"prosperous.\" The Hiro cutting core is made of SG2 micro-carbide steel. This ultra-fine-grained steel is incredibly hard and dense, enabling Shun to make thinner blades that can be sharpened to a razor-like 16° cutting angle. At the same time, SG2 offers unmatched edge retention, so it's superb for kitchen use. Due to this combination of performance and durability, SG2 is considered by many to be the world's best blade steel for use in kitchen knives. In 150 handcrafted steps, every curve has been meticulously smoothed and rounded, from spine to heel, while each cutting edge has been precisely sharpened to make every cutting task a pleasure. True to its Eastern heritage, the Shun Hiro's handle follows straight off the blade for a grip Asian-style knife enthusiasts prefer. Made of premium charcoal-colored PakkaWood with deep crimson striations, the handle is also adorned with an inlaid brass-and-steel Samurai family crest mosaic and a mirror-polished nickel silver bolster and end cap. Handcrafted in Seki, Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q5OOyA+JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shun","source_asin":"B077J8ZML3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077J8ZML3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077J8ZML3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
