window.products.push({"id":536835,"name":"Vamcheer Cooling Pillowcase Standard Size - Double Side Q-Max 0.45 Chill Pillow Covers, 2 Pack Breathable Cold Pillow Cases with Hidden Zipper, Anti-S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tDYjXPD5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【NEWEST COOLING TECH】Vamcheer cooling pillowcases are made of newest Japanese Q-Max >0.45 arc-chill cooling fibers. Far exceeding other fibers, this fibers material will naturally absorb the heat and moisture discharged from the body and accelerate moisture evaporation and feel cool while touching, they will let you quietly in the irritable night fall asleep. 【DOUBLE-SIDED COOLING DESIGN】Our cooling pillowcase is made of Japanese Arc-Chill Q-Max >0.45 Cooling Fibers. (Surface: 70% NyIon + 30% PoIyethyIene, Back: 100% NyIon). The larger the Q-max value, the more heat the fabric takes away. That’s why our's cooling pillowcase is the best at absorbing body heat to transfer away from you as you sleep. Especially helpful for hot sleepers to fight night sweats and insomnia. 【HIDDEN ZIPPER DESIGN】Our cooling pillowcase adopt mini hidden zipper design, makes this pillow cover beautiful and keeps it safe to use. The zipper of the pillowcase can be put on and taken off easily and smoothly, durable and lasts a long time. You will own set of 2 beautiful star print pillowcases and a beauty and comfortable sleep. 【HAIR & SKIN FRIENDLY】Tightly woven cooling fibers of pillowcases have natural antistatic properties, make your hair smoother and frizz-free when you wake up each morning. The tight weave allows the skin and hair to slide over the pillowcase very gently and freely, helping to reduce facial wrinkles and protects skin moisture. The cooling pillowcases provide good breathability and moisture absorption, keeping skin fresh and avoiding night sweats. 【BEST SUMMER GIFT】Beautifully packaged and easy to carry, our cooling pillowcases are perfect for home, travel, camping or on the go to enjoy the cool summer anytime, the perfect summer gift for your family and friends. 【EASY CARE & CLEANING】This cooling pillow covers are easy to replace and clean, both hand and machine washable. Please follow washing and care instructions: < 30°C mild wash, do not bleach, do not iron, do not dry clean, hang in the shade. Recommend that you wash them inside a laundry bag, to prevent entanglement during washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tDYjXPD5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vamcheer","source_asin":"B0BM3LHBQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM3LHBQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM3LHBQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
