window.products.push({"id":536848,"name":"Fruit Storage Containers for Fridge, 3 Pack Fridge Produce Saver Container, Refrigerator Organizer Bins with Vented Lids & Removable Drain Tray & Divi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eaf0651FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍓【Keep Fresh】A fresh container can keep veggies and fruits fresh never looked better. Each container comes with a lid which includes a sealing ring and adjustable vents, it helps regulate airflow and control humidity to prevent spoilage. 4mm raised bottom design can separate the washed vegetable from water to prevent them from spoiling. Keep fruits and vegetables clean, as fresh as two weeks ago. 🍋【Reasonable Space Utilization】The built-in dividers allow you to make more reasonable use of storage space. Placing the divider horizontally can divide the vegetable container into two layers, while placing it vertically, the fruit containers can be divided into two sides, or you can remove it directly. Each storage container is matched with a drain basket which can be used as a colander. ⚠️NOTE: The smallest size container does not have a Divider 🍇【Clear, Safety, Easy to Use】 Clear color so you're able to see inside of the fruits container. And it's made of premium food-safe material which is BPA free. It will resist stains and odors, and are easy to clean with soap and warm water! ⚠️NOTE: NOT dishwasher wash. ⚠️ HOW TO SEAL LIDS TIGHTLY: Please buckle the buckle on one side of the lid, and then lock the buckle on the other side, which helps to seal the lid to the container tightly. 🍒【Make The Refrigerator Cleaner】Sbamdon fruit storage containers include large, medium and small container for your fruits, vegetables and salads, allowing you to easily put them in the compartment of the refrigerator. The clear boxes filled with colorful produce dress up your refrigerator. 🍊【Multiple Uses】Bring our practical, portable, high-quality storage containers to your family and friends! They can be used to store many types of fruits or vegetables, such as lettuce, tomatoes, strawberry, and grapes. Reduce the messy refrigerator storage, and save more space structure for the fridge. Not only can they store food at home, they are also a great idea for outdoor activities such as picnics, camping or road trips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eaf0651FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sbamdon","source_asin":"B097YFLB4P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-536848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097YFLB4P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097YFLB4P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
